# renv -- .Rprofile is tracked (needed to auto-activate renv on clone);
# renv/ has its own .gitignore for the local library/cache

# output/ IS tracked: .github/workflows/monthly-update.yml commits the
# monthly <country>_panel.csv / _coverage.json + output/vintages/ archive
# back to the repo, since GitHub Actions runners are ephemeral.

# Python. The package is installed into the machine's shared environment
# (pip install -e ".[dev]"), not into a virtualenv inside the repository.
